ity protection.\n- Designed for optimal heat dissipation.\n- Portable, Easy to carry.\n- Certified by both RoHS and CE.\n.','/uploads/products/awt-awt-c2.jpg',0,'2026-07-29 04:41:26.895','2026-07-29 04:41:26.895'),(437,'awt-awt-c4','AWT C4','AWT','awt','accessories','charger-battery','READY STOCK\n.\nAWT C4\nCharger 2A 4 Slot\n*100% Authentic \n.\nParameter:\nBrand: AWT C4\nWeight: 210g\nCycle life: >500times\nSize: 132*78*35mm\nInput Power: 10w\nInput Current: 2A\nInput Voltage: AC 100~240V 50/60HZ or DC 12V\nOutput Voltage: 4.2V 1% / 1.48V 1%\nOutput Current:\n1000mAh *2\n1500mAh *2\n2000mAh *2\n\nCompatible with:\n* Li-ion: 26650, 22650, 18650, 17670, 18490, 17500, 17335, 16340(RCR123), 14500\n.','/uploads/products/awt-awt-c4.webp',0,'2026-07-29 04:41:26.902','2026-07-29 04:41:26.902'),(438,'wick-n-vape-bacon-prime','Bacon Prime','WICK N VAPE','wick-n-vape','accessories','cotton','READY STOCK\n.\nBACON PRIME\n*100% Authentic By Wick N Vape\n.\nSpecification :\n- The most cutting edge, cleanest and easy to use Cotton Bacon\n- PERFECT for squonking, tanks and RDA\n- 33% faster absorption, easier separation\n- 4 inch length, heavy body, easy to use bacon strip\n- U.S. Grown dual fiber for optimal wicking and heat resistance\n- no more break-in. 100% TASTELESS wick\n- Large fibers for low ohm builds, minimal dry hits\n- User friendly, resealable travel size package\n- Net\nWeight: 0.35oz (10gr) of cotton wicking material\n.','/uploads/products/wick-n-vape-bacon-prime.jpeg',1,'2026-07-29 04:41:26.909','2026-07-29 04:41:26.909'),(439,'emkay-bananalicious-60ml','Bananalicious 60ML','Emkay','emkay','liquid','freebase','READY STOCK\n.\nBANANALICIOUS\n*100% Authentic By Emkay Brewer x CMW Distribution\n.\nFlavour : Banana Cream Strawberry\nNicotine : 3MG | 6MG\nVolume : 60ML\nPG/VG : 30/70\n.','/uploads/products/emkay-bananalicious-60ml.webp',1,'2026-07-29 04:41:26.916','2026-07-29 04:41:26.916'),(440,'emkay-bananalicious-less-sweet-60ml','Bananalicious LESS Sweet 60ML','E