rd\n1x User Manual\n1x USB Type-C Cable\n.','/brand/IMG_3820.PNG',0,'2026-07-29 04:41:28.903','2026-07-29 04:41:28.903'),(779,'silo-silo-rba-for-dotaio','SILO RBA FOR Dotaio','SILO','silo','atomizer','rba','READY STOCK\n.\nSILO RBA FOR DOTAIO\n*100% Authentic By Orca Vape x jG\n.\nFeatures :\n– Tank Capacity 4.4mL Refillable\n– Dual Post Build Deck\n– Top Secured via Flathead Screws\n– Single Coil Configuration\n– Surgical Stainless Steel Construction\n– Bottom Adjustable Airflow Control Ring\n– Compatible for :\n– DotAio V1\n– DotAio V2\n.\nIncludes :\n1x SILO RBA\n7x Airflow Pins\n1x Pack of Spare Gaskets\n1x 510 Build Adapter','/uploads/products/silo-silo-rba-for-dotaio.webp',0,'2026-07-29 04:41:28.909','2026-07-29 04:41:28.909'),(780,'dr-juice-soursop-hanna-pf-soursop-juice-30ml','Soursop Hanna PF - Soursop Juice 30ML','Dr. Juice','dr-juice','liquid','saltnic','READY STOCK\n.\nSOURSOP HANNA PODS FRIENDLY\n*100% Authentic By Dr.Juice\n.\nFlavour : Ice Soursop Juice\nNicotine : 15MG\nVolume : 30ML\nPG/VG : 50/50\n.','/uploads/products/dr-juice-soursop-hanna-pf-soursop-juice-30ml.webp',0,'2026-07-29 04:41:28.916','2026-07-29 04:41:28.916'),(781,'cair-e-liquid-status-fwb-strawberry-sirsak-30ml','Status FWB - Strawberry Sirsak 30ML','CAIR E-liquid','cair-e-liquid','liquid','saltnic','READY STOCK\n.\nSTATUS FRIEND WITH BENEFIT SALTNIC\n*100% Authentic By Erika Putri (Erikaputreal)\n.\nFlavour : Strawberry Sirsak\nNicotine : 25MG\nVolume : 30ML\nPG/VG : 50/50\n.','/brand/IMG_3820.PNG',0,'2026-07-29 04:41:28.921','2026-07-29 04:41:28.921'),(782,'erika-putri-status-hts-himalayan-lemon-30ml','Status HTS - Himalayan Lemon 30ML','Erika Putri','erika-putri','liquid','saltnic','READY STOCK\n.\nSTATUS HUBUNGAN TANPA STATUS SALTNIC\n*100% Authentic By Erika Putri (Erikaputreal)\n.\nFlavour : Himalayan Lemon\nNicotine : 25MG\nVolume : 30ML\nPG/VG : 50/50\n.','/brand/IMG_3820.PNG',0,'2026-07-29 04:41:28.926','2026-07-29 04:41:28.926'),(783,'erika-putri-status-single-mangga-nanas-